{"attempt_count":2,"attempts":[{"attempt_id":"query-A1-70d8544b479064fe","baseline_ref":"bde4169c71920fc965aad905e1336a5b999b2cb4","checkpoint_ref":"15ad2ba73c324477ca8b36fc3303ea62da8a82b7","execution":{"concerns":[],"status":"completed","summary":"查询可执行选区或当前语句，取消走独立通道，历史只载入不自动执行。","verification_refs":[]},"review":{"checkpoint_ref":"15ad2ba73c324477ca8b36fc3303ea62da8a82b7","decision":"changes_requested","findings":[{"blocking":true,"description":"MySQL/MariaDB 多语句批次不在同一条借出的连接上执行。mysql_run 每条语句 pool.get_conn()，函数结束即归还。drivers.rs 只把池限制设为 0..1，PoolOpts::new() 仍是 mysql_async 0.37.1 的默认 reset_connection=true；get_conn 把该标志写到连接上，回收器在归还时执行 COM_RESET_CONNECTION。这会回滚未提交事务、丢掉临时表和会话变量。界面仍按语句报告成功。例如 START TRANSACTION; INSERT ...; COMMIT; 中 INSERT 的影响行数在重置前已经记下，随后重置把插入回滚，COMMIT 再在空事务上成功，历史和结果都显示完成，行却不在库里。PostgreSQL 复用同一个 Client，SQLite 复用 max_connections=1 且不重置，不受此影响。应在整批执行期间持有同一条已打开连接并关闭归还重置，而不是每条语句借还，也不要为执行另开数据库连接。","location":"src-tauri/src/query/exec.rs:369","priority":"P0"},{"blocking":true,"description":"同一连接可以同时跑两批 SQL。connection_busy 在 align_database().await 和历史写入之前就放开锁，运行槽要等这两次 await 之后才插入；前端 connectionBusy 也要等 query_start 返回才记入。两个标签连续执行时，两边都能通过检查。池只有一条连接，语句会按借还次序交错。MySQL 的 USE 发生在各自的 align 里，后一次 USE 会改变前一批后续语句的数据库。应在任何 await 之前占住该连接的运行槽，或用覆盖整批的连接锁，失败时撤掉占位。","location":"src-tauri/src/query/commands.rs:107","priority":"P1"},{"blocking":true,"description":"结果上限没有限制从数据库读入的规模。limit 只决定保留多少行。MySQL 在 truncated 之后继续 result.next() 直到结束；PostgreSQL 的 query_raw 同样把剩余行读完后丢掉，prepare 失败时 simple_query 会先把整份结果放进内存再截断。大结果会占住这条唯一连接直到读完，界面上的截断也不是可继续读取的未读批次。R19 要求超过默认上限时不要自动无限读取。SQLite 在达到 limit 后停止流，没有这个问题。应在服务器侧限制读取（例如 LIMIT），不要把整份结果拉到客户端再丢弃。","location":"src-tauri/src/query/exec.rs:397","priority":"P1"},{"blocking":true,"description":"历史写入失败会把连接永久标成忙。start_run 先插入 status=running 的槽，再 await history() 和 insert；任一失败就把错误返回给界面，但没有人移除槽，也没有 spawn 执行任务。connection_busy 把 running 视为占用，此后该连接上的查询都返回“已有正在执行的查询”，直到进程重启。历史失败时应删除或结束这个槽。","location":"src-tauri/src/query/commands.rs:148","priority":"P1"}],"review_base_ref":"bde4169c71920fc965aad905e1336a5b999b2cb4","summary":"Task review completed with 4 finding(s)"},"review_evidence_refs":["evidence/reviews/sha256-4297a1975eeb4592ad441bbe2365e734b17b404ca31c2d1b26cb6ccf3900f2b9.json"],"scope_delta":{"entries":[{"path":"src-tauri/capabilities/default.json","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"},{"path":"src-tauri/gen/schemas/acl-manifests.json","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"},{"path":"src-tauri/gen/schemas/capabilities.json","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"},{"path":"src-tauri/gen/schemas/desktop-schema.json","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"},{"path":"src-tauri/gen/schemas/windows-schema.json","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"},{"path":"src-tauri/permissions/app-commands.toml","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"},{"path":"src-tauri/src/connections/drivers.rs","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"},{"path":"src-tauri/src/connections/mod.rs","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"},{"path":"src-tauri/src/connections/service.rs","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"},{"path":"src-tauri/src/lib.rs","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"},{"path":"src/shell/AppShell.vue","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"},{"path":"src/shell/StatusBar.vue","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"},{"path":"src/shell/WorkspaceView.vue","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"},{"path":"src/shell/session.ts","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"},{"path":"src/shell/shell.test.ts","reason_code":"repo_local_reconciled","route":"auto_approved"}]}},{"attempt_id":"query-A2-bfeec172be1a4df7","baseline_ref":"15ad2ba73c324477ca8b36fc3303ea62da8a82b7","checkpoint_ref":"d73bb8d48452a1d385c15bc0d78c324c